# Slice 11: areas under roots. Newton (De Analysi, NATP00204): sqrt(aa + xx) gives the hyperbola's area,
# sqrt(aa - xx) the circle's; a letter is put for the root (Methodus, Problem 1).
# the hyperbola: logarithms
integral(sqrt(x^2 + 1), x)
integral(1/sqrt(x^2 + 1), x)
integral(x/sqrt(x^2 + 1), x)
integral(x^2 sqrt(x^2 - 1), x)
integral((x + 1)/sqrt(x^2 + 2x + 5), x)
integral(1/sqrt(4x^2 + 1), x)
# the circle: arcs
integral(sqrt(1 - x^2), x)
integral(1/sqrt(1 - x^2), x)
integral(1/sqrt(2x - x^2), x)
integral(x^3/sqrt(1 - x^2), x)
# a root of a straight line: the root is the new flowing letter
integral(sqrt(x + 1), x)
integral(1/(x sqrt(x + 1)), x)
integral(x sqrt(2x + 3), x)
integral(1/(1 + sqrt(x + 1)), x)
# rational parts beside the root
integral(1/(x^2 + 1) + x sqrt(x^2 + 1), x)
# definite areas
integral(sqrt(1 - x^2), x, 0, 1)
integral(1/sqrt(1 - x^2), x, 0, 1)
integral(1/sqrt(1 - x^2), x, 0, 1/2)
integral(1/sqrt(x^2 + 1), x, 0, 1)
integral(sqrt(x^2 - 1), x, 1, 2)
integral(sqrt(x + 1), x, 0, 3)
integral(1/sqrt(x + 1), x, -1, 0)
integral(1/(x sqrt(x + 1)), x, 1, 3)
integral(sqrt(1 - x^2), x, 0, 1) to 40 places
x^(3/2) + integral(x^(1/2), x)
# refusals, with the reason
integral(1/sqrt(x^3 + 1), x)
integral(sqrt(x + 1) + sqrt(x + 2), x)
integral(1/(x sqrt(x^2 + 1)), x)
integral(sqrt(x^2 - 1), x, 0, 2)
integral(sqrt(x^2 - x), x, 0, 3)
integral(1/(x sqrt(x + 1)), x, -1/2, 1)
integral(sqrt(a^2 - x^2), x)
integral(sqrt(-x^2 - 1), x)
